## Grid model

Per lift `<table>` in `ExerciseCard`, one matrix of **6 columns × N set rows**. Column index is **logical**, not DOM:

| col | address | testid (keep) | skipped chrome after it |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| 0 | `plan.kg` | `rx-weight` | `×` |
| 1 | `plan.reps` | `reps` | `@` |
| 2 | `plan.rpe` | `targetValue` | RPE/% **toggle** (not a cell) then the plan→log copy **button** (not a cell) |
| 3 | `log.kg` | `${liftId}-actual-weight` | `×` |
| 4 | `log.reps` | `${liftId}-reps` | `@` |
| 5 | `log.rpe` | `${liftId}-executedRpe` | Δ / e1RM / INOL / duplicate / delete (not cells) |

Row index = set index `0..N-1` of **this lift only**. Do **not** jump into another lift’s table.

```
plan.kg → plan.reps → plan.rpe → log.kg → log.reps → log.rpe
```

Then (Tab wrap only) next set’s `plan.kg`.

**Not cells** (skip): set index, `×` `@`, plan→log arrow, RPE/% **unit toggle**, Δ, e1RM, INOL, duplicate, delete, lift header, + Set, “use {suggested}”. The unit toggle still clicks as today; keyboard nav skips it.

Locked / readonly rows: not in the grid; no edit; existing disabled chrome stays.

Give every cell a **unique address** for focus: `data-cell-id="{liftId}:{setIndex}:{plan|log}:{kg|reps|rpe}"`. PLAN cells **must** receive `rowIndex` + `liftId` from `ExerciseCard` through `PrescriptionEditor`. Keep existing `data-testid`s so current e2e locators still resolve. Do **not** navigate with `document.getElementById(...).click()`.

