2. **Tab kg→reps:** select plan kg set 0, press Tab → selected plan **reps** set 0 (testid `reps` on that row). No input mounted. A second Tab → plan rpe. A third Tab → **log kg** (testid `${id}-actual-weight`). Focus must **not** be the copy-plan→log button.
